---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy">
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-32 bg-slate-50">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
		<p class="text-slate-500 mb-12">Last updated: October 24, 2024</p>

		<div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">1. What Are Cookies</h2>
				<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help us provide a secure and seamless experience. We use strictly necessary cookies to authenticate your session when you access the Admin Dashboard or Client Portal.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
				<p>We use cookies for security and authentication purposes. When you log in, we issue a secure JWT token to ensure your API requests are encrypted and verified.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">3. Managing Cookies</h2>
				<p>You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent. However, if you do not accept cookies, you may not be able to log into the RMG portal or use our trading infrastructure.</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>